cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the U.S. Harmonized Vital Statistics resource, please cite the relevant subproject deposit(s) below."
title: "U.S. Harmonized Vital Statistics Microdata"
abstract: >
  A unified resource integrating harmonized U.S. natality, linked birth–infant death, and fetal death public-use microdata
  released by the National Center for Health Statistics (NCHS) into stable parquet column schemas spanning multiple
  Standard Certificate revisions and NCHS layout reformats. Each product is validated against every per-year figure
  NCHS publishes in the relevant National Vital Statistics Reports series.
authors:
